    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a significant step towards understanding the intricacies of brain aging and resilience, the Brain Resilience Kenya Study was officially launched on September 10, 2024. The groundbreaking research initiative, spearheaded by the Aga Khan University's Brain and Mind Institute (BMI), aims to shed light on how various life stressors impact cognitive decline and dementia in Kenyan adults.",
